WEBVTT

00:00:01.923 --> 00:00:05.723
The beginning breeze

00:00:06.194 --> 00:00:09.994
Delivers this message

00:00:10.431 --> 00:00:18.998
"Because I have always believed in you"

00:00:20.141 --> 00:00:20.675
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.675 --> 00:00:28.716
The Story of Saiunkoku
We are standing in the land
we dreamed of back then

00:00:28.716 --> 00:00:29.011
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:36.520
We feel weak at the knees a little,
gazing over the scenery

00:00:36.758 --> 00:00:40.888
But please don't look back

00:00:41.029 --> 00:00:45.056
Because you've decided to go forward

00:00:45.266 --> 00:00:49.362
I looked up into the sky to see
the rainbow with seven colors

00:00:49.637 --> 00:00:53.073
Can you see it too?

00:00:53.341 --> 00:00:57.243
The beginning breeze

00:00:57.645 --> 00:01:01.376
Delivers this message

00:01:01.816 --> 00:01:09.985
I will watch over you as
you go forth to chase your dreams

00:01:10.358 --> 00:01:18.561
The dancing winds in the blazing sun

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:28.671
Fly forth strongly
with the wings of freedom

00:01:33.514 --> 00:01:35.482
The sky is clear.

00:01:36.250 --> 00:01:39.515
However, the weather is something
that changes all the time.

00:01:41.489 --> 00:01:45.016
Just as soon as you notice clouds
gathering, it may begin to rain.

00:01:45.860 --> 00:01:49.694
And then, from time to time,
a typhoon arrives.

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:57.460
A Genius Can't Better a Hardworking Man

00:02:03.544 --> 00:02:05.808
Is something wrong,
Consort Hong?

00:02:06.481 --> 00:02:09.780
Shusui, have you seen
the inkstone case that I keep here?

00:02:10.618 --> 00:02:11.880
No.

00:02:11.953 --> 00:02:15.184
Excuse me.
I've brought you your tea.

00:02:15.957 --> 00:02:19.791
Korin. Have you seen
Consort Hong's inkstone case?

00:02:21.896 --> 00:02:23.295
Uh, no.

00:02:23.765 --> 00:02:26.825
A few of my things
have gone missing lately.

00:02:27.001 --> 00:02:29.936
My embroidery needle and
incense pouch are missing too.

00:02:31.305 --> 00:02:32.932
You might've misplaced
them somewhere.

00:02:34.942 --> 00:02:37.638
Anyway, I'll keep looking
a little longer.

00:02:40.281 --> 00:02:42.181
This really is strange.

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:47.147
Have you determined
the composition of poison...

00:02:47.221 --> 00:02:48.518
...on the things
I gave you yesterday?

00:02:48.589 --> 00:02:51.183
According to the report
from Koyu and Doctor To...

00:02:52.727 --> 00:02:55.127
...the poison being used
is getting stronger.

00:02:57.598 --> 00:02:59.566
An embroidery needle,
an incense pouch...

00:02:59.634 --> 00:03:01.067
...and an inkstone case.

00:03:01.135 --> 00:03:03.262
Anything they can
get their hands on, I guess?

00:03:03.337 --> 00:03:07.330
In fact, it's as if they're telling us
to notice the poison being used.

00:03:07.875 --> 00:03:10.070
It only seems
that obvious to you, King.

00:03:10.311 --> 00:03:13.838
This kind of thing was an almost
daily occurrence long ago, after all.

00:03:16.984 --> 00:03:19.817
It's the heightened awareness
of the dangers around you...

00:03:19.887 --> 00:03:22.014
...that's helped you
survive so far, right?

00:03:24.792 --> 00:03:27.260
Now then, what do you intend
to do about Lady Shurei?

00:03:27.328 --> 00:03:30.354
Every night I've secretly been giving her
a specially prepared antidote...

00:03:30.431 --> 00:03:33.832
...so there's no need to worry.
And, the source of the poison?

00:03:34.469 --> 00:03:39.202
It's coming from the same source.
Nevertheless, it's very strange...

00:03:39.273 --> 00:03:42.709
...that the perpetrator keeps
choosing items that can be traced.

00:03:43.177 --> 00:03:45.111
Don't jump to conclusions just yet.

00:03:45.179 --> 00:03:47.340
Please continue to investigate
other possible suspects as well.

00:03:47.415 --> 00:03:48.541
I understand.

00:03:48.916 --> 00:03:50.110
I'm counting on you.

00:03:50.451 --> 00:03:54.649
No problem. I did accept
your purple iris after all, right?

00:03:56.657 --> 00:03:57.749
Shurei.

00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:02.196
Um... Ah... I made some
fried sesame dumplings, but...

00:04:02.263 --> 00:04:06.632
...compared to dumplings, flowers are
the thing, right! Flowers, of course!

00:04:06.701 --> 00:04:08.362
I'm sorry for interrupting you!

00:04:09.670 --> 00:04:11.035
What was that all about?

00:04:11.105 --> 00:04:15.303
She still thinks you're interested
in men, Your Majesty.

00:04:16.811 --> 00:04:19.746
I'm afraid that if I tell Shurei the truth,
she'll just run away from me.

00:04:19.814 --> 00:04:22.146
She just ran,
even without you telling her.

00:04:28.656 --> 00:04:30.385
What's going on
between those two?

00:04:30.458 --> 00:04:34.258
Are they close enough to be giving
flowers to one another? I had no idea.

00:04:41.035 --> 00:04:42.764
What extravagant clothes!

00:04:44.071 --> 00:04:46.039
Oh, good afternoon.

00:04:48.075 --> 00:04:50.373
What are those round objects
you have there?

00:04:54.182 --> 00:04:56.207
These are sesame dumplings.
Would you like one?

00:05:01.489 --> 00:05:02.615
How is it?

00:05:03.591 --> 00:05:05.388
The combination of the
grainy texture of sesame seeds...

00:05:05.459 --> 00:05:07.290
...the softness of the sticky rice...

00:05:07.361 --> 00:05:09.795
...and the sweet red bean paste
inside is exquisite.

00:05:09.864 --> 00:05:12.765
It's a triple tier, triple cheer
surprise experience for the palate.

00:05:17.905 --> 00:05:20.840
You know, a simple "thank you"
would be nice.

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:35.245
Um... may I ask you a question?

00:05:35.756 --> 00:05:38.520
Are you playing the flute
as a way to thank me for the dumpling?

00:05:40.161 --> 00:05:42.561
The moment you think
or feel something...

00:05:42.630 --> 00:05:44.825
...that action gives birth to meaning.

00:05:44.899 --> 00:05:49.199
Oh... What's your name?

00:05:49.670 --> 00:05:51.729
- I'm...!
- Ryuren!

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:54.139
General Ran!

00:05:54.208 --> 00:05:56.369
Long time no see,
Silly Brother Number Four.

00:05:56.444 --> 00:05:58.412
What? Silly Brother?

00:05:58.713 --> 00:06:00.510
It's the name I gave
my pathetic older brother.

00:06:00.581 --> 00:06:03.607
This is my younger brother
Ryuren Ran, Lady Shurei.

00:06:03.718 --> 00:06:05.185
Younger brother?!

00:06:05.786 --> 00:06:08.380
What are you doing here in Kiyo?

00:06:08.789 --> 00:06:10.950
A wanderer has no objective.

00:06:11.926 --> 00:06:14.793
Good lord. How on earth
did you get in here in the first place?

00:06:14.862 --> 00:06:17.695
What?! He got past
the tight security of the palace?

00:06:17.832 --> 00:06:22.360
Well, this guy has the ability
to sneak into any place.

00:06:24.538 --> 00:06:25.664
He's gone.

00:06:25.806 --> 00:06:27.000
Damn it.

00:06:27.942 --> 00:06:32.470
I hear that both Shuei Ran and
Koyu Ri have accepted flowers.

00:06:35.049 --> 00:06:39.418
Everything seems to be progressing
as you anticipated, Sho.

00:06:40.221 --> 00:06:44.123
For the time being, at least.
What's that?

00:06:49.096 --> 00:06:50.893
I just heard the sound of a flute
from over there.

00:06:51.098 --> 00:06:54.590
We can't afford to let him wander
around unsupervised. Let's hurry.

00:06:56.203 --> 00:07:00.003
Why do I have to join
their little search party?

00:07:02.109 --> 00:07:04.236
I win again.

00:07:10.451 --> 00:07:13.420
You bastard!
One more round!

00:07:14.255 --> 00:07:15.449
There he is!

00:07:15.756 --> 00:07:16.950
Please excuse us.

00:07:18.059 --> 00:07:20.084
Oh, hi. Silly Brother Number Four.

00:07:25.733 --> 00:07:28.133
Just what have you been doing
with the court's Three Elders?

00:07:28.502 --> 00:07:31.232
I was concerned that their old age
is keeping them from having fun...

00:07:31.305 --> 00:07:33.102
...so I taught them how
to play cards.

00:07:33.941 --> 00:07:35.704
How did this happen, anyway?

00:07:35.776 --> 00:07:38.609
I warned him about the awful sound
he was making with his flute...

00:07:38.779 --> 00:07:41.976
...and he responded by saying
he would only stop if we won.

00:07:45.953 --> 00:07:46.977
Now.

00:07:48.322 --> 00:07:52.019
We are terribly sorry for my younger
brother's impolite behavior.

00:07:54.462 --> 00:07:56.430
- We're going.
- Not so fast!

00:07:57.164 --> 00:07:59.064
- One more game!
- Let's do it!

00:07:59.133 --> 00:08:01.226
We can't end this on a losing note!

00:08:02.169 --> 00:08:04.034
W-We'll excuse ourselves now.

00:08:04.939 --> 00:08:06.372
- Wait!
- Hey!

00:08:06.440 --> 00:08:08.874
- Stop right there!
- You can't just win and run!

00:08:11.412 --> 00:08:14.210
You shouldn't spoil a game like that,
Silly Brother Number Four!

00:08:15.216 --> 00:08:17.275
Your younger brother is
really something...

00:08:17.351 --> 00:08:19.012
...to evoke a sigh like
that from you.

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:22.887
I'd ask him to go away, but there's
no way he'll just leave obediently.

00:08:23.324 --> 00:08:27.021
For now, since he's here anyway, why
don't we show him around the palace?

00:08:27.595 --> 00:08:28.687
All right...!

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:34.964
This is a painting of
the Eight Colored Enlightened Ones.

00:08:35.302 --> 00:08:37.031
That's obvious just looking at it.

00:08:37.671 --> 00:08:40.003
I can't keep a conversation going
with that guy.

00:08:40.141 --> 00:08:42.371
Quite the peculiar
younger brother, isn't he?

00:08:42.676 --> 00:08:45.304
I hear he's been wandering
from place to place...

00:08:45.379 --> 00:08:47.313
...playing cards as he was just now.

00:08:47.381 --> 00:08:49.144
How audacious.

00:08:49.316 --> 00:08:51.580
But that guy is Ryuren Ran.

00:08:52.353 --> 00:08:55.322
Only geniuses are allowed
to take the name Ryuren Ran.

00:08:55.790 --> 00:08:58.486
I'm the fourth child,
and have three older brothers...

00:08:58.559 --> 00:09:01.084
...but the one deemed worthy to bear...

00:09:01.162 --> 00:09:03.153
...the name Ryuren Ran was him,
the youngest.

00:09:03.230 --> 00:09:05.494
Even over his four older brothers?!

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:08.168
My younger brother
certainly is odd...

00:09:08.235 --> 00:09:10.567
...but the Ran Clan is expecting
great things from him.

00:09:10.638 --> 00:09:11.969
He's always wandering around...

00:09:12.039 --> 00:09:14.599
...and even if you can catch him,
you can hardly talk with him.

00:09:14.675 --> 00:09:19.476
So, if he's really difficult to control,
he won't be easily manipulated.

00:09:19.914 --> 00:09:23.680
Even like he is, the Ran Clan considers
my younger brother indispensable.

00:09:30.591 --> 00:09:32.024
What do you think
you're doing?!

00:09:32.560 --> 00:09:34.391
I'm gonna stay here tonight.

00:09:35.463 --> 00:09:36.896
I want to sleep here.

00:09:39.266 --> 00:09:41.632
Where did you stay last night?

00:09:42.536 --> 00:09:45.198
I was counting the stars
as I fell asleep.

00:09:45.272 --> 00:09:46.500
So you camped out.

00:09:46.574 --> 00:09:49.634
Ryuren, no matter what your reason,
this is no place for you to sleep.

00:09:49.710 --> 00:09:52.008
Why not stay
with your older brother?

00:09:52.246 --> 00:09:54.146
There's no way I want to
spend the night...

00:09:54.215 --> 00:09:56.046
...with a tasteless,
unrefined man like him.

00:09:56.117 --> 00:09:58.483
- Then do you want to stay at my place?
- You're gonna make...

00:09:58.552 --> 00:10:00.520
...Shoka deal with him?

00:10:02.056 --> 00:10:05.082
- In that case, Koyu, your place will do.
- What?!

00:10:05.226 --> 00:10:07.717
What a good idea!
Please Koyu.

00:10:11.031 --> 00:10:12.362
All right.

00:10:23.144 --> 00:10:27.171
There are nothing but books here.
There isn't a shred of taste in this room.

00:10:27.281 --> 00:10:28.441
Shut up.

00:10:37.691 --> 00:10:39.124
Oh, Your Majesty.

00:10:39.693 --> 00:10:40.751
Advisor Sa.

00:10:40.828 --> 00:10:44.161
Are you on your way to
Consort Hong's room again tonight?

00:10:44.331 --> 00:10:45.389
That's right.

00:10:45.666 --> 00:10:49.693
Seeing the two of you growing so close
to one another pleases me greatly.

00:10:49.770 --> 00:10:51.135
Now, give this some thought.

00:10:51.205 --> 00:10:54.470
My granddaughter is as pretty
as Consort Hong...

00:10:54.542 --> 00:10:56.942
...and has a lovely personality.

00:10:58.712 --> 00:11:02.148
Shurei is the only consort I need.
There's no need for any others.

00:11:02.650 --> 00:11:05.642
My, that Consort Hong
certainly has you smitten.

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:07.248
S-S-Smitten?

00:11:07.321 --> 00:11:09.516
It means you've fallen
head over heals in love.

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:14.184
Well, if you happen to change
your mind, please let me know.

00:11:25.906 --> 00:11:27.464
Shurei, I'm coming in.

00:11:28.108 --> 00:11:29.166
All right.

00:11:46.627 --> 00:11:47.924
Ryuki.

00:11:47.995 --> 00:11:49.189
Wh-What is it?

00:11:49.263 --> 00:11:52.721
I'm gonna study a little longer
so go ahead to bed without me.

00:11:57.171 --> 00:12:00.265
I see you're more determined to study
than I am, though I'm the king.

00:12:00.341 --> 00:12:02.502
That's because I'm no genius.

00:12:02.843 --> 00:12:06.142
But they say, "A genius can't better
a hardworking man", right?

00:12:06.814 --> 00:12:10.580
If you were a man,
you'd make a great official.

00:12:14.521 --> 00:12:16.716
When I was a child,
it was my dream...

00:12:16.890 --> 00:12:19.791
...to take the Civil Service Exams
and become a Court Official.

00:12:20.261 --> 00:12:22.456
But thanks to me entering
the Royal Harem...

00:12:22.529 --> 00:12:26.522
...I'm able to study like this
and reflect on the affairs of the country.

00:12:27.301 --> 00:12:30.134
I feel like I'm allowed
to be a little closer to that dream.

00:12:30.838 --> 00:12:33.705
So, don't mind me, Ryuki.
You go ahead to bed.

00:12:37.911 --> 00:12:42.871
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:12:49.456 --> 00:12:51.617
Koyu, are you all right?

00:12:52.826 --> 00:12:56.592
I didn't get a wink of sleep last night!
All because of that guy!

00:12:57.064 --> 00:12:58.622
What the hell is with him?!

00:12:58.699 --> 00:13:01.035
I have no idea what's going on
in that head of his!

00:13:01.035 --> 00:13:02.236
He went and laid down
in the courtyard...

00:13:02.236 --> 00:13:04.170
...so he could look at the moon
as he fell asleep!

00:13:04.271 --> 00:13:06.073
Then out of nowhere he started
playing that damn flute!

00:13:06.073 --> 00:13:08.598
And on top of all that,
first thing in the morning...

00:13:08.676 --> 00:13:11.042
...he said he wanted to weed the lawn,
and I had to help him!

00:13:11.445 --> 00:13:15.404
Helping out with the weeding
was very nice of you, Koyu.

00:13:15.716 --> 00:13:17.775
But you really must do
something about...

00:13:17.851 --> 00:13:20.115
...your frighteningly
bad sense of direction.

00:13:20.354 --> 00:13:23.790
- You got lost in your own house.
- Mind your own business!

00:13:25.359 --> 00:13:27.623
You'd better do something about this,
Silly Brother Number Four!

00:13:27.695 --> 00:13:30.823
Well, I have to get back to
taking care of palace security.

00:13:30.898 --> 00:13:32.456
Don't you try to escape!

00:13:33.667 --> 00:13:36.693
Ryuren, you truly strike me
as a guy who stands above us all.

00:13:36.770 --> 00:13:38.260
- Do something about your
stupid brother!
- Let go of me!

00:13:38.339 --> 00:13:39.897
Shut up! Take some responsibility
as an older brother.

00:13:39.973 --> 00:13:43.033
However, you caused trouble to
the person who's kindly taken you in.

00:13:43.110 --> 00:13:45.203
The proper thing to do is apologize.

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:49.280
- Right?
- Silly Brother Number Four
do something!

00:13:49.350 --> 00:13:50.476
Come on.

00:13:52.953 --> 00:13:55.786
Now, the proper way to apologize
is with an "I'm sorry", right?

00:13:58.392 --> 00:14:00.326
I'm... sorry.

00:14:00.828 --> 00:14:02.921
Uh, ah, it's okay.

00:14:05.232 --> 00:14:07.894
I should say sorry too,
for acting so self-important.

00:14:08.302 --> 00:14:11.760
Well, I'd hate to
bother Koyu any further...

00:14:12.239 --> 00:14:14.707
...so why don't we go to my room
and have some tea?

00:14:14.775 --> 00:14:17.767
And then tonight I insist that you come
over and spend the night at my house.

00:14:31.091 --> 00:14:32.058
Please.

00:14:32.426 --> 00:14:33.518
Thank you.

00:14:33.794 --> 00:14:37.355
Silverware. I see you're not without
your own difficulties here, Shurei.

00:14:38.332 --> 00:14:39.663
What do you mean?

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:44.132
Don't you know? Silverware will change
color if it comes in contact with poison.

00:14:44.204 --> 00:14:45.171
Really?!

00:14:47.508 --> 00:14:48.975
Are you all right?

00:14:49.343 --> 00:14:50.640
I'm sorry.

00:14:55.883 --> 00:15:00.081
I wasn't aware that silverware
was used for that purpose.

00:15:02.022 --> 00:15:04.320
Ryuki saved me once...

00:15:05.192 --> 00:15:08.355
...but I need to be more aware
and start looking out for myself.

00:15:10.631 --> 00:15:14.192
That woman Shusui, do you know
anything about her background?

00:15:15.302 --> 00:15:17.202
She's my lady-in-waiting.

00:15:17.271 --> 00:15:18.972
She seems to have had
considerable training...

00:15:18.972 --> 00:15:20.735
...for a lady-in-waiting,
to move like that.

00:15:20.808 --> 00:15:23.868
You're right. Shusui has a very
elegant manner.

00:15:24.745 --> 00:15:26.906
You can be so dimmy-witty.

00:15:27.281 --> 00:15:28.475
Dimmy-witty?

00:15:30.284 --> 00:15:32.752
Shurei, and... who's that?

00:15:33.520 --> 00:15:35.715
Shurei. How would you like
to travel with me?

00:15:36.890 --> 00:15:39.552
This life here doesn't suit you.

00:15:40.794 --> 00:15:43.592
You, who dares to seduce my consort.
Who are you?

00:15:45.065 --> 00:15:46.191
Your Majesty!

00:15:47.334 --> 00:15:50.861
This is Ryuren Ran.
General Ran's younger brother.

00:15:51.238 --> 00:15:52.432
Of the Ran Clan?

00:15:56.810 --> 00:16:00.712
Shurei is not a bird fit for a cage. She's
a bird that should fly freely in the sky.

00:16:01.281 --> 00:16:05.047
Yes. Let's have chickeny-chicken
hot pot tonight.

00:16:06.353 --> 00:16:10.585
Yesterday's dumplings were delicious.
Tonight, I'll make dinner for you.

00:16:10.691 --> 00:16:14.218
Ah, Ryuki, I'm going home
for the night, okay?

00:16:17.564 --> 00:16:19.896
I have no intention of having her
become a caged bird.

00:16:19.967 --> 00:16:20.956
Your Majesty.

00:16:21.435 --> 00:16:22.402
Seiran.

00:16:22.836 --> 00:16:24.804
What are you doing out here?

00:16:26.006 --> 00:16:28.566
Oh, I was just talking to
Shuei's little brother.

00:16:29.142 --> 00:16:32.509
That young man from the Ran Clan
who's visiting the palace?

00:16:32.913 --> 00:16:36.371
Yeah. Apparently, he'll be
staying at Shurei's house tonight.

00:16:36.884 --> 00:16:39.011
I've heard he's quite unusual.

00:16:39.620 --> 00:16:41.815
But he and Shurei seem
to get along.

00:16:42.756 --> 00:16:46.715
Seiran, could you go home
with Shurei tonight?

00:16:47.427 --> 00:16:49.952
If you're worried,
I'll send some guards over.

00:16:50.364 --> 00:16:52.924
I'd like to stay here and investigate
something a little further.

00:16:53.767 --> 00:16:56.634
If you're talking about that, I asked
Shuei to look into it as well.

00:16:57.271 --> 00:16:58.704
Don't do anything reckless.

00:17:00.007 --> 00:17:00.996
Right.

00:17:08.782 --> 00:17:09.874
Here you go!

00:17:12.452 --> 00:17:14.352
Didn't you say we're having
chicken hot pot?

00:17:14.688 --> 00:17:15.712
Yes I did.

00:17:17.558 --> 00:17:19.753
You need soybeans for chicken pot?

00:17:21.628 --> 00:17:25.758
This tiny little round thing... For some
reason I'm suddenly drawn to it.

00:17:31.939 --> 00:17:33.429
You broke them.

00:17:33.574 --> 00:17:35.439
This is a problem, sir.

00:17:36.009 --> 00:17:39.035
I apologize. In payment
for the broken eggs, take these.

00:17:39.112 --> 00:17:40.044
What?

00:17:40.113 --> 00:17:41.375
What's this?

00:17:41.915 --> 00:17:46.375
This much?! Wait, sir.
Take this in return!

00:17:49.623 --> 00:17:51.853
Well, it's a little closer
to chicken, but...!

00:17:53.961 --> 00:17:55.952
- But please!
- Can't be done.

00:17:56.229 --> 00:17:57.753
I understand.

00:17:58.198 --> 00:17:59.563
What's the matter?

00:18:00.867 --> 00:18:04.530
I wanted to buy some eggs
for my sick husband to eat...

00:18:04.671 --> 00:18:06.605
...but I don't have enough money.

00:18:06.673 --> 00:18:09.233
Well then, I'll exchange these eggs
for those green onions.

00:18:09.676 --> 00:18:13.134
What? Would you really, sir?
Thank you very much!

00:18:15.582 --> 00:18:20.451
It's a little closer to hot pot, but...
we're further away from chicken.

00:18:21.121 --> 00:18:23.089
Hey Ryuren, you...!

00:18:24.224 --> 00:18:26.385
If it's okay with you,
I'd like to make an exchange.

00:18:26.460 --> 00:18:27.586
S-Sure.

00:18:27.661 --> 00:18:28.753
Thank you.

00:18:37.004 --> 00:18:39.404
Just what kinda theory are you
basing these exchanges on?

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:41.535
There is no theory.

00:18:41.608 --> 00:18:43.599
And that chickeny-chicken hot pot?

00:18:43.677 --> 00:18:45.201
It's become nothing more
than an illusion.

00:18:45.746 --> 00:18:49.705
I don't think I'll be able to stand
being with Ryuren much longer.

00:18:54.087 --> 00:18:55.315
What's the matter?

00:18:56.023 --> 00:18:59.652
The wind blew away the straw I was
going to use to make a raincoat.

00:19:01.862 --> 00:19:03.454
What am I gonna do?

00:19:12.706 --> 00:19:13.798
Thank you!

00:19:24.351 --> 00:19:26.819
This is great! Tonight we can
pick vegetables from our garden...

00:19:26.887 --> 00:19:29.014
...and make veggie-veggie hot pot!

00:19:29.122 --> 00:19:30.384
You're not angry?

00:19:30.957 --> 00:19:32.925
This reminds me of an old folk tale.

00:19:33.026 --> 00:19:35.221
The story of a man who began
with a single piece of straw...

00:19:35.295 --> 00:19:37.286
...and traded up until
he became a rich man.

00:19:37.364 --> 00:19:39.889
What you did is the opposite, Ryuren...

00:19:40.233 --> 00:19:42.827
...but all the same,
I still had a lot of fun.

00:19:52.279 --> 00:19:56.682
Shurei. Are those troops outside our
front gate here on the king's orders?

00:19:56.983 --> 00:20:00.612
It seems so. It's probably because
I told him I'd be staying at home tonight.

00:20:03.156 --> 00:20:05.021
Ryuren. Would you like
another helping?

00:20:05.425 --> 00:20:07.222
Please make yourself at home.

00:20:12.165 --> 00:20:14.360
There was a little piece of vegetable
stuck to your face.

00:20:19.539 --> 00:20:21.234
Ryuren, you...!

00:20:22.242 --> 00:20:23.300
What is it?

00:20:23.410 --> 00:20:25.503
That's the first smile
I've seen from you.

00:20:26.179 --> 00:20:28.272
It's nothing to be surprised about.

00:20:31.651 --> 00:20:32.743
I guess not.

00:20:32.986 --> 00:20:37.855
Have more, before the food gets cold.
Let's eat. Ryuren, you're spilling it!

00:20:41.728 --> 00:20:43.696
Well, take care
of yourself, Ryuren.

00:20:43.764 --> 00:20:44.731
Right.

00:20:47.801 --> 00:20:48.995
General Ran!

00:20:49.770 --> 00:20:51.203
The thought that
my younger brother...

00:20:51.271 --> 00:20:53.364
...may have caused you trouble
was worrying me.

00:20:53.607 --> 00:20:55.871
No, not at all.
He was no trouble.

00:20:55.976 --> 00:20:58.570
General Ran, there was no need
for you to worry.

00:20:59.045 --> 00:21:00.945
Shurei. I should get going.

00:21:02.315 --> 00:21:03.509
Take care.

00:21:03.817 --> 00:21:09.687
But I hope you'll remember,
you're my kindred spirit.

00:21:11.124 --> 00:21:13.456
My kindred spirit, for life.

00:21:16.296 --> 00:21:17.422
Thank you.

00:21:22.669 --> 00:21:24.261
Well then, farewell.

00:21:30.811 --> 00:21:33.211
Next time we meet will probably be
at the Civil Service Exams.

00:21:33.280 --> 00:21:34.508
The Civil Service Exams?

00:21:34.581 --> 00:21:35.548
Yes.

00:21:36.149 --> 00:21:38.674
He will be taking
the Civil Service Exams.

00:21:38.785 --> 00:21:40.912
And, he had to promise
to get results...

00:21:40.987 --> 00:21:42.955
...that place him in the top three.

00:21:43.523 --> 00:21:44.820
Why is that?

00:21:45.826 --> 00:21:48.727
That's the condition that allows
him to travel around like this.

00:21:48.795 --> 00:21:51.696
I see. The Civil Service Exams.

00:21:52.332 --> 00:21:54.630
Shurei, I must thank you.

00:21:55.669 --> 00:21:59.105
You're the first person that didn't
run away from my younger brother.

00:21:59.506 --> 00:22:00.700
That can't be true.

00:22:00.941 --> 00:22:04.138
His eccentricity has always
isolated him.

00:22:04.711 --> 00:22:06.679
That's because he's a genius.

00:22:06.746 --> 00:22:09.510
I'm sure he sees things differently
than the rest of us.

00:22:09.583 --> 00:22:14.020
Which can also mean he's unable
to see the world as others do.

00:22:14.421 --> 00:22:17.948
It must be terribly lonely,
enduring that kind of isolation.

00:22:18.959 --> 00:22:21.587
But now he has a friend
for the first time.

00:22:23.797 --> 00:22:25.765
A kindred spirit.

00:22:40.780 --> 00:22:41.872
Hey, Ryuki.

00:22:43.383 --> 00:22:44.577
What is it?

00:22:44.651 --> 00:22:48.143
You know, I've never been able to do
anything unless I put in a lot of effort.

00:22:48.622 --> 00:22:51.853
I had to practice endlessly before
I was able to play this erhu.

00:22:52.792 --> 00:22:57.855
It's hard to keep up the effort,
but being a genius must be hard too.

00:23:00.033 --> 00:23:02.126
Yes. I will try my best, too.

00:23:04.571 --> 00:23:07.904
Now, please accept these!
These are my gifts to you!

00:23:08.608 --> 00:23:12.305
I'm trying my best to earn your love.
How am I doing, Shurei?

00:23:12.879 --> 00:23:16.406
For you, I'll do whatever it takes.

00:23:16.483 --> 00:23:19.680
Ah, Sh-Shurei?

00:23:20.787 --> 00:23:26.089
There's nothing I hate more than
someone who wastes his money!!

00:23:30.530 --> 00:23:35.627
You've always led a very carefree life
and right now

00:23:35.769 --> 00:23:42.333
Amidst this rain
what sort of dreams are you chasing?

00:23:42.442 --> 00:23:47.505
And while you are fighting
loneliness somewhere

00:23:47.614 --> 00:23:52.608
You must be holding back
the tears too

00:23:53.687 --> 00:23:58.147
You say you'll be fine alone

00:23:59.693 --> 00:24:04.824
You are just like me

00:24:05.565 --> 00:24:10.093
Even if we have to take
the longer way around

00:24:10.170 --> 00:24:16.075
We somehow still prefer this route

00:24:17.043 --> 00:24:22.845
Whenever I feel happy or glad

00:24:22.949 --> 00:24:27.818
I will always think of you

00:24:28.955 --> 00:24:41.629
I believe that the colorful seasons will
deliver this feeling of mine to you

00:24:45.105 --> 00:24:45.405
Next Episode

00:24:45.405 --> 00:24:47.941
Next Episode
Ryuki has become
very much like a king.

00:24:47.941 --> 00:24:48.074
Next Episode
It won't be long before my work here
will come to an end.

00:24:48.074 --> 00:24:50.276
Next Episode
Lacking the Finishing Touch
It won't be long before my work here
will come to an end.

00:24:50.276 --> 00:24:51.077
Next Episode
Lacking the Finishing Touch

00:24:51.077 --> 00:24:53.680
Next Episode
Lacking the Finishing Touch
This feeling of relief
is making me sleepy.

00:24:53.680 --> 00:24:54.271
Next Episode
Lacking the Finishing Touch

00:24:54.347 --> 00:24:57.282
Where am I? By chance,
have I been kidnapped?!
